# VLM2Vec Evaluation Workflow

## Evaluation Components

### Main Evaluation Script
- [eval.py](mdc:eval.py) - Main evaluation script for MMEB-V2 benchmark
- [experiments/public/eval/](mdc:experiments/public/eval/) - Evaluation configurations

### Evaluation Infrastructure
- [src/eval_utils/](mdc:src/eval_utils/) - Evaluation utilities and metrics
- [src/data/eval_dataset/](mdc:src/eval_dataset/) - Evaluation dataset loaders
- [src/data/collator/eval_collator.py](mdc:src/data/collator/eval_collator.py) - Evaluation data collation

### Benchmark Datasets
- MMEB-V2: 78 total datasets covering images, videos, and visual documents
- Video tasks: retrieval, moment retrieval, classification, QA
- Visual document tasks: document retrieval
- Image tasks: classification, retrieval, VQA, etc.

### Evaluation Metrics
- Retrieval: R@1, R@5, R@10, mAP
- Classification: Accuracy
- VQA: Accuracy
- Video: Moment retrieval metrics

### Distributed Evaluation
- Supports DDP inference on multiple GPUs
- Streamlined evaluation process
- Can complete full benchmark evaluation within hours

## Key Evaluation Commands
```bash
# Run evaluation on specific tasks
python eval.py --model_name path/to/model --task_name task_name

# Run full MMEB-V2 evaluation
python eval.py --model_name path/to/model --eval_all_tasks
```

## Evaluation Tips
- Use distributed evaluation for faster processing
- Monitor evaluation progress with logging
- Check evaluation results in `experiments/public/all_scores/`
- Compare with baseline models in leaderboard
